@capability:compose-implementation-design
@root-scenario:compose-implementation-design
Feature: Compose the implementation design by altitude

  @scenario:compose-implementation-design
  @input:compose-implementation-design-request
  @input-contract:implementation-design-request.v1
  @event:compose-implementation-design-requested
  @event-authority:compose-implementation-design.v1
  @outcome:implementation-design-review
  @outcome-contract:implementation-design-review.v1
  Scenario: Compose the implementation design by altitude
    Given a retained specification digest and the capability id it describes
    When every altitude authors its design section through its own governed provider lane and the chain converges the accumulated sections
    Then the implementation design review revision is returned for owner approval
